# Paper Folding — a sheet folded in three (three RN views with chained rotateX/translateY transforms over Skia shaded rects); tapping anywhere unfolds/folds it with a 1 s overdamped spring plus a triple haptic tick.
# What this test covers: unfold and fold fully settled, re-tapping mid-spring (the target flips at progress 0.5, so a
# tap before the halfway point re-targets the same end and one after reverses), a rapid tap burst, taps far from
# the paper (the full-screen pressable), a long press, and ending folded.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/paper-folding"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 1000
# Unfold, settle; fold, settle.
press 201 437
wait 1600
press 201 437
wait 1600
# Unfold and tap again early (progress < 0.5: same target) then late (> 0.5: reverses).
press 201 437
wait 150
press 201 437
wait 600
press 201 437
wait 1600
# Rapid burst.
press 201 437 --count 7 --interval-ms 110
wait 1800
# Taps away from the paper still toggle.
press 80 700
wait 1600
press 330 250
wait 1600
# Long press toggles on release.
longpress 201 600 900
wait 1600
# Make sure it ends folded or unfolded without a stuck intermediate state.
press 201 437
wait 1600
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
